    \emph{pañcamūla}s, the \emph{laghupañcamūla} (the \egls{laghupañcamūla} and \egls{bṛhatpañcamūla}, with differing properties.  Combined they are called \emph{daśamūla} (\gls{daśamūla}).  See also \volcite{1}[468]{josi-maha}}


