type={plants}}%
{gamboge}%
{\gvdb{441, 461--462} describes the two varieties mentioned in the \emph{Suśrutasaṃhitā}, and the three mentioned by Ḍalhaṇa. Candidates are Garcinia morella (Gaertn.) Desr.\ (gamboge) and Euphorbia thomsoniana Boiss.  The latter plant is native to Pakistan, Afghanistan and regions north \citep{kew}; its latex is toxic on ingenstion and dangerously irritant}


