{gourd}%
{This is a guess.  According to some lexical sources, syn.\ for \egls{marica} \citep[929]{moni-sans}. See \volcite{1}[\#1929]{NK}. \citet[362]{gvdb} note that \emph{vall\v iphala} may be \egls{kūṣmāṇḍa}, which I follow.  The related \gls{karkāruka} has poisonous seeds, but not flowers.  Commenting on \emph{Bṛhatsaṃhitā} 8.13ab and 16.24ab, Bhaṭṭotpala glossed it as \emph{mudgādi}, "mung beans etc."}


