\bibglsnewentry{ambaṣṭhā}%
{sort={hibiscus|},
type={plants}}%
{hibiscus}%
{possibly Hibiscus rosa-sinensis L. \citet[18--19]{gvdb} discuss the confusions surrounding the identity of this plant, and especially between this plant and \egls{pāṭhā}; they must be different items. \citeauthor{gvdb} propose that \emph{ambaṣṭhā} is either the fruit of Hibiscus or the galls of a Quercus or Tamarix species.  According to \cite[599]{meul-1974}, \emph{vanakārpāsī} is more likely a name for a hibiscus}


