{marsh barbel}%
{Hygrophila auriculata, Schumach. Only occurs at \SS\ 4.4.32 and not in the \CS. In the \cite[441]{josi-maha}, later sources are cited that identify it with ``a kind of \egls{vetasa}," ``a kind of \egls{jambū}" ``\egls{mustā}," and so on. \cite[249]{adps} identifies it with \egls{kokilākṣa} because it grows in marshy ground. See \egls{ikṣuraka}}


